WEBVTT

00:17.000 --> 00:17.670
Your Highness!

00:36.704 --> 00:39.110
So you're the coward who shot
that arrow from the shadows.

00:40.030 --> 00:40.600
Talk.

00:41.470 --> 00:42.750
Who sent you?

00:55.070 --> 00:56.640
Stop the carriage! Stop!

00:57.520 --> 00:58.390
The horse is spooked!

00:58.960 --> 01:00.390
The horse is spooked! It won't stop!

03:08.100 --> 03:08.912
=Blossoms of Power=

03:08.912 --> 03:11.700
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:11.780 --> 03:14.740
=Episode 12=

04:00.910 --> 04:01.840
Gu Qingshu,

04:02.630 --> 04:05.240
looks like I went too
easy on you last time.

04:05.584 --> 04:07.190
You clearly haven't learned your lesson.

04:08.800 --> 04:10.120
Since you want to kill me,

04:10.710 --> 04:11.870
why not make it quick?

04:41.390 --> 04:42.830
Why don't you kill me?

04:43.680 --> 04:44.680
Remember today.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.000
If there's a next time,

04:46.576 --> 04:48.510
you won't even have the chance
to beg for mercy.

05:28.800 --> 05:30.360
Your Highness, why are you here?

05:30.680 --> 05:32.560
I was hoping to invite you to dinner.

05:33.360 --> 05:35.750
Young Master Shen said
you came to Fahua Temple.

05:36.160 --> 05:37.560
So I came to try my luck.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.870
Did you come looking for me,

05:39.936 --> 05:41.424
or have you been following me all along?

05:44.870 --> 05:45.510
Both.

05:47.240 --> 05:48.120
Who else but you

05:48.720 --> 05:50.510
could make me forget about dinner,

05:51.240 --> 05:52.310
ignore my frail health,

05:52.310 --> 05:53.830
and disregard the cold of the night,

05:56.560 --> 05:57.920
just to see you?

06:00.310 --> 06:01.510
I originally thought

06:01.510 --> 06:03.310
that Young Master Bu
was quite the flirt.

06:03.552 --> 06:05.630
But I didn't expect
that compared to the Crown Prince,

06:05.800 --> 06:06.950
he's not even close.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.430
Why don't we trouble Young Master Bu

06:12.040 --> 06:13.070
to hunt some game for us?

06:14.390 --> 06:15.160
Me?

06:15.160 --> 06:16.190
I like rabbit meat.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.480
As you command.

06:23.104 --> 06:25.136
It might take a while
for Young Master Bu to hunt.

06:25.560 --> 06:27.190
Why don't we take a walk together?

06:40.368 --> 06:42.432
Let's take shelter
in that pavilion over there.

06:42.510 --> 06:43.000
All right.

07:09.170 --> 07:11.590
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

07:12.690 --> 07:15.230
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

07:16.360 --> 07:21.310
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

07:23.520 --> 07:26.340
♪Every answer I gave♪

07:27.140 --> 07:29.990
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

07:30.780 --> 07:34.150
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

07:34.250 --> 07:37.720
♪How hard it truly was?♪

07:40.610 --> 07:44.130
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

07:45.120 --> 07:47.450
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

07:48.720 --> 07:54.480
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

07:55.890 --> 07:59.020
♪It's a shame I never could♪

07:59.470 --> 08:02.480
♪Give you a moon in return♪

08:03.328 --> 08:05.136
I've loved the rain since I was a child.

08:06.240 --> 08:07.560
If it rains at night,

08:07.760 --> 08:09.296
sleeping to the sound of the rain

08:10.310 --> 08:11.510
is especially peaceful.

08:13.040 --> 08:14.310
If it rains during the day,

08:14.640 --> 08:16.120
listening to the sound of the rain

08:17.070 --> 08:18.630
feels as if all my sorrows

08:18.736 --> 08:20.800
can be cleared away
like clouds parting for the sun,

08:21.160 --> 08:22.270
and simply vanish.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.560
As far as I know,

08:31.568 --> 08:33.000
it rarely rains in the northwest.

08:44.670 --> 08:45.320
Youyou.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.720
In front of me,

09:01.670 --> 09:02.840
you can say anything.

09:04.390 --> 09:05.120
But, Youyou,

09:06.176 --> 09:08.176
you must be wary of those
with ill intentions.

09:29.040 --> 09:30.944
Now that my coming-of-age ceremony
is complete,

09:32.000 --> 09:33.360
when should we report to my father?

09:36.320 --> 09:37.360
Let's wait a few days.

09:38.080 --> 09:39.150
My brother

09:39.510 --> 09:41.360
hasn't agreed to this marriage yet.

09:42.000 --> 09:43.200
I have to persuade him.

09:45.630 --> 09:47.080
If Young Master Shen doesn't agree,

09:47.630 --> 09:48.750
will you

09:49.120 --> 09:50.000
change your mind?

09:51.240 --> 09:52.270
We are allies.

09:53.296 --> 09:54.630
Since we have an agreement,

09:55.320 --> 09:56.630
I will never go back on my word.

10:00.870 --> 10:01.600
Good.

10:03.840 --> 10:05.240
Then I will be like this rain.

10:05.720 --> 10:06.720
Though it is gentle,

10:07.480 --> 10:08.720
it can wear away stone.

10:10.240 --> 10:11.320
I will carve our promise

10:12.270 --> 10:13.550
on the Three-life Stone,

10:14.030 --> 10:15.000
never to be broken.

10:31.540 --> 10:39.340
(Memorial Tablet for the Late Lady Gu)

10:44.300 --> 10:47.420
(Memorial Tablet for the Late Lady Gu)

11:04.600 --> 11:05.360
Brother-in-law!

11:05.720 --> 11:06.790
You can't go in.

11:08.510 --> 11:09.600
Don't stop me.

11:09.600 --> 11:11.360
His Highness said that he won't see you.

11:11.360 --> 11:12.840
Please calm down. Calm down.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.460
Brother-in-law.

11:13.472 --> 11:14.176
Calm down.

11:15.200 --> 11:16.870
I don't want to marry
into the Chu family.

11:22.360 --> 11:23.240
You may all leave.

11:23.550 --> 11:24.270
- Yes.
- Yes.

11:30.750 --> 11:31.750
The Chu family,

11:32.600 --> 11:33.910
though not a prominent clan,

11:33.910 --> 11:35.264
is an upstanding and noble family.

11:35.488 --> 11:37.480
Young Master Chu is a man
of upstanding character.

11:37.480 --> 11:38.480
A true gentleman.

11:38.600 --> 11:39.550
This marriage

11:40.030 --> 11:41.510
is one I chose for you myself.

11:42.440 --> 11:43.480
I won't marry him.

11:44.112 --> 11:45.910
I want to stay by your side,
Brother-in-law.

11:46.670 --> 11:47.390
Otherwise...

11:48.870 --> 11:50.750
Otherwise, I will die here today.

12:04.150 --> 12:05.390
Even if you die,

12:06.480 --> 12:08.870
you will be buried
in the Chu family's ancestral tomb.

12:16.030 --> 12:18.120
Just because I provoked Shen Xihe,

12:20.390 --> 12:21.720
you're treating me like this?

12:21.984 --> 12:24.080
If not for the fact
that you are of the Gu bloodline,

12:24.910 --> 12:26.320
for such audacity,

12:26.768 --> 12:28.360
I would have dealt with you long ago.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.000
You're so cruel to me.

12:43.220 --> 12:45.540
(Prince Xin's Manor)

12:52.180 --> 12:58.580
(Prince Xin's Manor)

12:59.670 --> 13:00.750
Young Lady Qingshu,

13:01.000 --> 13:02.000
are you all right?

13:05.270 --> 13:06.910
I threatened to kill myself,

13:08.120 --> 13:09.960
but I still couldn't convince
my brother-in-law.

13:11.080 --> 13:11.720
Then,

13:12.992 --> 13:15.240
does this mean you have
to marry into the Chu family?

13:15.260 --> 13:16.940
(Prince Xin's Manor)

13:16.960 --> 13:18.630
Why is it that she, Gu Qingzhi,

13:19.670 --> 13:21.120
could marry a prince,

13:24.390 --> 13:26.270
while I'm just a pawn
at everyone's mercy?

13:27.120 --> 13:28.750
What should we do now?

13:30.848 --> 13:32.440
The Empress Dowager's maternal family

13:32.440 --> 13:34.510
once had ties with the ancestors
of the Gu family.

13:36.200 --> 13:37.960
Because of this connection,

13:38.000 --> 13:39.840
the Empress Dowager
takes great pity on me.

13:40.160 --> 13:42.910
She allows me to visit her often
at Yong'an Hall to keep her company.

13:43.750 --> 13:45.600
If I can make a prince

13:46.080 --> 13:47.510
fall for me,

13:49.150 --> 13:50.510
I'll have a way

13:50.840 --> 13:52.720
to ask the Empress Dowager
to decree a marriage.

13:53.920 --> 13:55.824
His Majesty is a devotedly filial son.

13:55.920 --> 13:57.870
As long as the Empress Dowager
makes the request,

13:58.120 --> 13:59.320
he will surely not refuse.

14:02.150 --> 14:04.510
I see. You've already
thought so far ahead.

14:06.480 --> 14:07.790
Pinning all one's hopes

14:08.360 --> 14:10.150
on a single man

14:11.790 --> 14:13.790
is the height of foolishness.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.240
In a few days,

14:16.320 --> 14:19.056
the Empress Dowager and His Majesty
will hold an investiture ceremony

14:19.790 --> 14:21.630
for Shen Xihe.

14:23.870 --> 14:26.270
All the princes will be in attendance.

14:33.500 --> 14:37.380
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

14:46.910 --> 14:48.240
Greetings, Your Highness.

14:49.200 --> 14:50.200
I have something

14:50.816 --> 14:52.960
I'd like to discuss
with the Commandery Princess alone.

14:56.000 --> 14:57.320
Your Highness, to what do I owe

14:57.600 --> 14:58.960
the pleasure of your visit?

15:00.360 --> 15:01.320
Shu...

15:03.240 --> 15:04.200
is reckless

15:05.000 --> 15:06.320
and has repeatedly offended you.

15:06.910 --> 15:07.790
As her brother-in-law,

15:07.790 --> 15:09.650
I have been remiss in my duty
to discipline her.

15:09.670 --> 15:11.216
I came today specifically to apologize.

15:11.870 --> 15:14.200
I hope you can be magnanimous

15:14.630 --> 15:15.910
and not stoop to her level.

15:18.120 --> 15:19.320
When I saved her,

15:19.320 --> 15:21.270
it was only to preserve
the Gu family bloodline.

15:21.440 --> 15:22.360
Recently,

15:22.720 --> 15:24.840
I have already arranged
a good marriage for her.

15:25.840 --> 15:26.910
Once she is married

15:27.104 --> 15:28.510
and leaves the imperial capital,

15:29.480 --> 15:31.320
she will no longer appear before you

15:31.392 --> 15:32.672
and cause you any displeasure.

15:35.030 --> 15:36.270
She may have been offensive,

15:37.360 --> 15:38.750
but I have already disciplined her.

15:39.910 --> 15:40.910
Let's drop the matter.

15:41.390 --> 15:43.200
There's no need to dwell on it,
Your Highness.

15:48.150 --> 15:49.630
Since you arrived in the capital,

15:50.870 --> 15:53.840
you threw Prince Kang's sister,
Lady Xiao, out of the manor,

15:54.550 --> 15:56.550
made Young Lady Hu reap what she sowed,

15:57.510 --> 15:59.550
and showed no mercy
to Princess Pingling.

16:00.270 --> 16:02.790
I thought you were the type
to avenge every wrong.

16:03.910 --> 16:05.000
Why...

16:05.600 --> 16:07.480
are you making an exception
for Gu Qingshu?

16:10.240 --> 16:11.840
People cherish old friendships.

16:12.096 --> 16:13.960
I was good friends
with her sister, Qingzhi.

16:15.030 --> 16:17.390
As for the last remaining member
of the Gu family,

16:17.390 --> 16:18.510
is showing some mercy

16:19.240 --> 16:20.150
so strange?

16:23.630 --> 16:25.030
You are truly righteous.

16:26.840 --> 16:27.870
I am impressed.

16:32.320 --> 16:33.150
This painting

16:33.870 --> 16:34.960
is my apology.

16:35.200 --> 16:36.200
I hope you will accept it.

16:44.700 --> 16:48.900
(Qing)

16:53.390 --> 16:54.510
These are among

16:54.790 --> 16:56.630
the few remaining paintings
my wife left behind.

16:57.200 --> 16:58.360
She was aloof and proud.

16:58.630 --> 16:59.910
Immensely talented,

17:00.790 --> 17:02.120
but she rarely showed it.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.310
It is indeed a fine painting.

17:09.590 --> 17:12.000
This is a kind and generous gesture
of yours.

17:12.080 --> 17:13.456
In that case, I shall accept it.

17:15.790 --> 17:17.200
I'll always remember

17:17.830 --> 17:19.640
the first time I met Qingzhi.

17:20.440 --> 17:22.000
That day, I went hunting in the woods.

17:23.310 --> 17:24.440
On my way back,

17:25.310 --> 17:26.440
heavy rain started to fall.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.960
So I found a woodshed to take shelter.

17:32.784 --> 17:34.200
And I happened to meet her there.

17:35.730 --> 17:37.270
It was in that moment that I understood

17:38.440 --> 17:39.680
that when some people meet,

17:42.624 --> 17:45.070
a single glance can be an eternity,
etched into your very soul.

17:50.270 --> 17:51.880
The brilliant glow of a thousand suns

17:53.030 --> 17:54.310
paled in comparison.

17:56.070 --> 17:57.160
From then on,

17:57.510 --> 17:58.830
she was engraved upon my heart.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.110
By the way,

18:12.310 --> 18:14.640
may I ask you to give me

18:15.590 --> 18:16.830
my late wife's letters

18:17.440 --> 18:18.440
as a keepsake?

18:19.750 --> 18:21.680
Those are letters
between Qingzhi and me.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.510
I cannot give them to you.

18:26.110 --> 18:26.830
In that case,

18:28.160 --> 18:29.440
I won't insist.

18:30.080 --> 18:31.792
If you ever face difficulties
in the future,

18:31.792 --> 18:33.200
just bring the letters and find me.

18:33.440 --> 18:35.030
I will do everything
in my power to help.

18:36.110 --> 18:37.510
I don't need anyone's help.

18:38.110 --> 18:40.110
And I certainly won't use
Qingzhi's letters

18:40.350 --> 18:41.350
to ask for favors.

18:43.960 --> 18:44.680
Zhen Zhu.

18:56.550 --> 18:58.960
These are all the letters
between Qingzhi and me.

18:59.020 --> 19:00.580
(For Xihe)

19:06.880 --> 19:08.030
Why are you doing this?

19:08.640 --> 19:09.750
The letters are mine.

19:10.070 --> 19:11.590
It's my decision what to do with them.

19:13.632 --> 19:14.750
The painting is also mine.

19:14.800 --> 19:16.304
I can do what I want with it, too.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.440
All burned.

19:20.240 --> 19:22.070
I did it so that you wouldn't cling

19:22.070 --> 19:23.400
to any lingering hopes.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.960
Lest you do something outrageous again.

19:27.510 --> 19:28.720
The dead are gone.

19:29.070 --> 19:31.510
Why let these inanimate objects
tie you down,

19:32.070 --> 19:34.110
wallowing in memories you can't escape?

19:37.056 --> 19:38.440
The day after tomorrow, His Majesty

19:38.510 --> 19:40.480
will personally
hold my investiture ceremony.

19:41.000 --> 19:41.960
I won't see you out.

20:10.300 --> 20:14.580
(Qing)

20:24.350 --> 20:25.510
You're so cruel.

20:29.000 --> 20:30.480
You're truly so cruel.

20:33.920 --> 20:35.270
But this ruthlessness

20:39.270 --> 20:40.640
makes me incredibly happy.

20:45.550 --> 20:47.160
Because you're just like

20:52.030 --> 20:53.350
you were before.

20:55.200 --> 20:56.680
In this world, a lady

20:57.200 --> 20:58.480
can only live happily and freely

20:58.750 --> 21:00.640
if she is unfeeling.

21:02.200 --> 21:03.680
A heartless person

21:04.070 --> 21:05.270
cannot have feelings.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.110
Your affection...

21:07.110 --> 21:07.720
Qingqing!

21:08.070 --> 21:09.790
- is destined to be misplaced.
- Qingqing!

21:13.240 --> 21:14.270
Do you recognize

21:16.160 --> 21:17.030
what this is?

21:19.590 --> 21:20.480
Changqing!

21:20.920 --> 21:22.550
- Calm down.
- Tell me now!

21:22.750 --> 21:23.640
I hope you...

21:23.640 --> 21:24.510
Who are you?

21:24.510 --> 21:25.960
will abandon that incredible delusion.

21:25.960 --> 21:27.240
Who are you?

21:27.240 --> 21:28.510
Stop chasing shadows.

21:29.480 --> 21:30.640
All burned.

21:31.000 --> 21:32.680
I did it so that you wouldn't cling

21:32.680 --> 21:34.030
to any lingering hopes.

21:37.550 --> 21:38.680
It's been so long.

21:41.620 --> 21:48.620
(Qing)

22:33.960 --> 22:35.880
Shen Yueshan, the Duke of Wei,

22:36.270 --> 22:39.110
guards northwest with outstanding merit
and service.

22:39.590 --> 22:41.270
His eldest daughter, Xihe,

22:41.480 --> 22:44.310
is gentle, virtuous,
and of graceful bearing.

22:44.352 --> 22:47.264
She is hereby specially conferred the
title of Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

22:47.328 --> 22:49.400
Having now received my favor
and entered the capital,

22:49.510 --> 22:52.310
she has abided by the rites
with reverence and propriety,

22:52.510 --> 22:55.440
greatly pleasing
both the Empress Dowager and I.

22:55.720 --> 22:59.030
Therefore, a special investiture
ceremony shall be held in Yong'an Hall.

22:59.120 --> 23:01.710
(Ning)
Besides, she is granted a golden plaque.

23:01.790 --> 23:04.720
With this, she may enter and exit
the palace grounds day or night.

23:04.790 --> 23:07.590
On urgent matters, she may
report directly to the throne

23:07.830 --> 23:09.640
without being announced.

23:10.510 --> 23:11.790
Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:40.320 --> 23:43.000
Congratulations, Xihe. His Majesty
personally conferred your title.

23:43.000 --> 23:44.030
Good things are coming.

23:44.030 --> 23:45.950
You're definitely going
to marry the Crown Prince.

23:45.968 --> 23:48.240
Then I wish you a happy married life.

23:48.240 --> 23:49.376
May every day be blissful.

23:54.510 --> 23:56.240
Well, I'll be on my way.

24:09.750 --> 24:10.750
Zhaoning.

24:11.960 --> 24:14.160
Princess Anling,
is something on your mind?

24:16.790 --> 24:17.590
It's nothing.

24:18.240 --> 24:19.400
Is it about Young Master Bu?

24:21.030 --> 24:22.310
As for Young Master Bu,

24:22.310 --> 24:24.016
I gave up the idea
of marrying him long ago.

24:24.032 --> 24:26.432
There are many other fine young men
in the imperial capital.

24:26.720 --> 24:28.310
You can take your time to choose.

24:30.128 --> 24:32.016
There's something you don't know,
Zhaoning.

24:32.048 --> 24:34.912
Actually, it's harder for a princess
to marry someone she truly desires.

24:36.030 --> 24:37.000
How so?

24:39.408 --> 24:41.456
After a princess marries
into her husband's family,

24:41.460 --> 24:44.020
her husband and parents-in-law
must pay their respects to her daily.

24:44.030 --> 24:45.540
My husband can't take concubines.

24:45.550 --> 24:48.200
To enter the princess's chambers,
he must first get her permission.

24:48.920 --> 24:51.300
Some sons of noble families
and prominent households

24:51.310 --> 24:52.960
are actually unwilling
to marry a princess.

24:52.960 --> 24:55.568
Especially someone like Young Master Bu,
from a family of generals,

24:55.570 --> 24:57.690
who is expected to achieve great things
in the future.

24:57.744 --> 24:58.350
So,

24:58.440 --> 25:00.688
I've never blamed him
for not taking an interest in me.

25:02.680 --> 25:04.750
You are able
to understand others' difficulties.

25:05.030 --> 25:06.640
You don't force things or hold grudges.

25:06.672 --> 25:08.336
That is truly a rare
and admirable quality.

25:09.030 --> 25:11.000
Among the young men
of noble and prominent families,

25:11.000 --> 25:12.960
there are many who wish to marry you.

25:13.296 --> 25:15.270
Fate will surely bring you
the right person one day.

25:20.400 --> 25:21.720
Sometimes I wonder

25:21.730 --> 25:23.632
why it must be a match
of equal social standing?

25:23.880 --> 25:24.880
Among the commoners,

25:24.928 --> 25:26.704
there are countless talented men
as well.

25:27.240 --> 25:29.160
You seem so troubled.

25:29.904 --> 25:31.776
Could it be you already
have someone in mind?

25:32.720 --> 25:33.350
No.

25:33.750 --> 25:35.750
I was just lost in thought.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.960
I can't hide anything from you.

25:49.550 --> 25:50.640
The other day,

25:50.960 --> 25:52.590
when I went to visit Changqing,

25:52.640 --> 25:55.270
I met an exceptionally talented
young man from a humble background.

25:56.590 --> 25:58.750
I fell for him at first sight.

25:59.350 --> 26:01.480
But his social standing is far too low.

26:01.680 --> 26:03.400
Unless he passes
the imperial examinations,

26:03.590 --> 26:05.030
it's absolutely impossible.

26:08.750 --> 26:10.070
I know it's impossible,

26:10.200 --> 26:11.590
but I just can't forget him.

26:18.350 --> 26:19.880
Is falling in love

26:20.310 --> 26:21.270
really a good thing?

26:24.440 --> 26:26.550
Falling in love can bring pain,

26:27.590 --> 26:29.920
but it can also give rise
to a kind of joy.

26:30.790 --> 26:31.960
A lifelong,

26:32.240 --> 26:33.680
incomparable joy.

26:44.030 --> 26:46.960
Your Highness, you've been leading me
around this garden aimlessly.

26:47.270 --> 26:48.510
What exactly is your intention?

26:49.056 --> 26:50.736
You've come from afar,
Young Master Shen,

26:50.752 --> 26:52.590
and I have yet to fulfill
my duties as a host.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.240
Today, we'll start with Yong'an Hall,

26:54.510 --> 26:56.880
and I'll show you the charms
of the imperial capital.

26:58.640 --> 27:01.480
Originally, you would have been able
to see the splendor of Changyu today.

27:03.720 --> 27:06.880
You mean Prince Yu, who is hailed
as the most handsome man in the capital?

27:09.550 --> 27:10.200
The very same.

27:11.200 --> 27:14.030
I heard he has the grace of an immortal
and is exceptionally handsome.

27:14.830 --> 27:16.240
He also sought to marry my sister.

27:16.920 --> 27:17.880
That is true.

27:19.640 --> 27:20.440
However,

27:21.000 --> 27:22.270
we only found out later

27:23.160 --> 27:24.440
that Changyu's beloved

27:24.440 --> 27:27.000
was a courtesan from Yunshao House,
Bian Xianyi.

27:28.000 --> 27:30.550
Unfortunately,
they are now separated by death.

27:30.640 --> 27:32.200
Coupled with the death of his mother,

27:32.304 --> 27:34.070
Changyu requested
to guard the imperial tombs

27:34.128 --> 27:35.424
to live out the rest of his days.

27:35.590 --> 27:37.790
How dare he!
If he already had someone he loved,

27:37.790 --> 27:39.200
how dare he seek to marry my sister?

27:39.744 --> 27:41.072
Don't be angry, Young Master Shen.

27:41.880 --> 27:42.590
Let's go this way.

27:42.592 --> 27:43.590
The scenery is better.

27:51.070 --> 27:52.240
Today, seeing the noble ladies

27:52.240 --> 27:53.960
vying to please
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

27:54.270 --> 27:55.480
you seem a little disappointed.

27:56.400 --> 27:58.030
I just don't want those people

27:58.030 --> 27:59.590
to compare me with my elder sister.

28:00.320 --> 28:02.790
In your veins flows the blood
of the imperial Xiao family

28:02.790 --> 28:04.510
and the renowned Shen family.

28:04.750 --> 28:05.480
Your noble status

28:05.480 --> 28:07.870
is something other ladies
can only dream of but never attain.

28:07.880 --> 28:09.030
To some people,

28:09.240 --> 28:10.350
the more they can't compare,

28:10.496 --> 28:13.216
the more they'll pick at others'
misfortunes to elevate themselves.

28:22.750 --> 28:23.750
Someone, help!

28:23.960 --> 28:25.000
Someone fell into the water!

28:25.000 --> 28:26.070
Help!

28:27.590 --> 28:28.790
Help!

28:28.790 --> 28:29.510
Yingruo!

28:32.768 --> 28:33.550
Save her, quickly!

28:33.680 --> 28:35.030
- Hurry! Hurry!
- Hurry!

28:35.030 --> 28:35.680
Hurry up.

28:36.200 --> 28:37.750
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

28:37.792 --> 28:38.720
Hold it, Your Highness!

28:56.688 --> 28:58.350
I apologize for alarming you,
Father.

28:58.368 --> 28:59.664
Please forgive me.

29:00.160 --> 29:01.070
Changmin,

29:01.200 --> 29:02.550
what exactly happened?

29:02.784 --> 29:04.030
Reporting to you, Father.

29:04.480 --> 29:06.720
Just now, I was passing
through the courtyard

29:06.752 --> 29:08.480
and saw Young Lady Shen
fall into the water.

29:08.480 --> 29:09.510
In the heat of the moment,

29:09.590 --> 29:10.976
I jumped into the water to save her.

29:13.110 --> 29:14.350
Young Lady Shen,

29:14.880 --> 29:15.830
are you unharmed?

29:17.270 --> 29:18.310
I am unharmed.

29:18.416 --> 29:20.272
Thank you for your concern,
Your Majesty.

29:20.750 --> 29:23.350
How did you suddenly lose your footing
and fall in?

29:23.550 --> 29:24.640
Reporting to Your Majesty.

29:25.310 --> 29:26.590
My lady was feeling a bit stuffy

29:26.688 --> 29:28.200
and wanted to get some fresh air here.

29:28.440 --> 29:30.000
A cat appeared out of nowhere

29:30.000 --> 29:30.944
and lunged right at her.

29:31.240 --> 29:32.480
My lady was startled,

29:32.752 --> 29:34.200
and that's how she fell into the water.

29:34.960 --> 29:36.310
Go summon the imperial physician

29:36.920 --> 29:38.400
lest she catch a cold.

29:39.480 --> 29:40.270
Father,

29:41.056 --> 29:42.480
I have one more matter to discuss,

29:42.592 --> 29:44.176
and I implore you to grant my request.

29:44.480 --> 29:45.510
Speak freely.

29:47.030 --> 29:48.240
I dare not hide it.

29:48.920 --> 29:50.200
Young Lady Shen and I

29:50.310 --> 29:51.720
indeed had

29:51.744 --> 29:53.328
intimate physical contact in the water.

29:53.344 --> 29:54.200
After today,

29:54.448 --> 29:55.424
who knows what kind of

29:55.430 --> 29:57.440
gossip will spread
throughout the imperial capital?

29:57.488 --> 29:59.568
I'm willing to take responsibility
for my recklessness.

30:00.480 --> 30:01.440
I wish

30:02.080 --> 30:03.872
to ask for Young Lady Shen's hand
in marriage

30:04.270 --> 30:05.240
as my second wife.

30:10.310 --> 30:11.590
Young Lady Shen,

30:11.750 --> 30:13.000
what are your thoughts?

30:16.440 --> 30:18.270
Thank you for saving my life,
Your Highness.

30:18.280 --> 30:20.820
But I have been a study companion
in the palace since I was young.

30:20.830 --> 30:22.720
I have always regarded you
as an older brother.

30:23.030 --> 30:25.400
As for my reputation,
the innocent have nothing to fear.

30:26.070 --> 30:27.240
I do not mind.

30:28.070 --> 30:28.590
Ruo.

30:28.590 --> 30:30.160
Your Highness, you are of noble status.

30:32.310 --> 30:33.590
But I am simple-minded.

30:33.792 --> 30:36.096
I am afraid I would be unworthy
of your kind intentions.

30:37.160 --> 30:38.590
Well, in that case,

30:39.310 --> 30:40.160
Changmin,

30:41.200 --> 30:42.070
rest assured.

30:42.550 --> 30:43.750
I will issue an order

30:44.310 --> 30:46.640
to ensure no rumors spread
within the palace.

30:49.310 --> 30:50.270
Thank you, Father.

30:53.152 --> 30:55.200
Changmin once asked
for Xihe's hand in marriage.

30:55.790 --> 30:57.350
But as you can see now,

30:57.408 --> 30:59.640
he is also interested
in your half-sister, Shen Yingruo,

30:59.936 --> 31:01.488
and is unwilling to let her go either.

31:02.030 --> 31:03.640
He's trying to have it both ways.

31:03.640 --> 31:04.590
His heart is fickle.

31:04.880 --> 31:05.590
How despicable.

31:06.960 --> 31:08.400
Young Master Shen, let's continue.

31:08.928 --> 31:10.368
We're still walking around?

31:12.590 --> 31:14.816
Today, royals, nobles,
and distinguished families,

31:14.848 --> 31:16.480
men and women alike,
are all gathered here.

31:16.480 --> 31:18.270
You will not only see
the beautiful scenery,

31:18.440 --> 31:21.310
but also witness many instances
of true, mutual affection.

31:21.664 --> 31:22.640
This way, please.

31:26.680 --> 31:28.200
I was too heavy-handed

31:28.590 --> 31:29.830
and injured your cat.

31:31.056 --> 31:32.896
What compensation would you like,
Your Ladyship?

31:32.944 --> 31:34.640
I will do my utmost to provide it.

31:35.310 --> 31:36.880
Don't worry about it, Your Highness.

31:37.920 --> 31:39.270
I wasn't watching it properly.

31:39.590 --> 31:40.510
It startled you.

31:41.424 --> 31:43.072
You were only acting in self-defense.

31:43.400 --> 31:44.200
You are not to blame.

31:45.440 --> 31:46.200
How about

31:46.640 --> 31:47.720
I send it to be checked

31:48.350 --> 31:49.504
to see if anything is wrong?

31:49.510 --> 31:51.820
We can also have the palace veterinarian
treat it right away.

31:51.830 --> 31:53.584
Thank you for your concern,
Your Highness.

31:54.400 --> 31:56.880
I have a physician at my residence
who specifically cares for it.

31:57.376 --> 31:59.184
I will take it back
to my residence shortly.

31:59.750 --> 32:00.920
In your heart,

32:01.440 --> 32:03.070
even the life of a cat

32:03.310 --> 32:04.480
is not to be taken lightly.

32:05.070 --> 32:06.070
For that alone,

32:06.550 --> 32:07.750
your virtue

32:08.200 --> 32:09.480
surpasses that of countless men.

32:14.750 --> 32:15.270
Please.

32:20.310 --> 32:22.440
Gu Qingshu, a master of manipulation.

32:22.790 --> 32:24.550
A cat, a hint of apology,

32:24.640 --> 32:26.000
and a display of reasonableness.

32:27.030 --> 32:28.240
This back and forth

32:28.240 --> 32:30.400
is enough for her
to gradually get acquainted

32:30.400 --> 32:31.270
with Prince Lie.

32:32.400 --> 32:33.640
She wants to marry Prince Lie?

32:35.110 --> 32:37.000
Changqing is cold
and indifferent to her.

32:37.310 --> 32:38.750
She must have changed her target.

32:39.750 --> 32:42.000
Changying is dashing and wealthy.

32:42.064 --> 32:43.900
He is naturally a prime candidate
for a husband.

32:43.920 --> 32:45.000
Even so,

32:45.240 --> 32:46.880
Prince Lie would never fall for her.

32:49.750 --> 32:52.400
To have a cat pounce on Changying
at just the right moment

32:52.400 --> 32:54.070
without arousing any suspicion,

32:54.750 --> 32:55.750
a lady like that

32:56.240 --> 32:57.270
cannot be underestimated.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.030
Even if she failed this time,

33:00.270 --> 33:02.750
Gu Qingshu definitely
has other tricks up her sleeve.

33:05.830 --> 33:07.750
Your imperial capital
is truly too chaotic.

33:08.960 --> 33:10.200
As you know,

33:10.864 --> 33:12.544
Prince Ning's heart belongs to another.

33:12.576 --> 33:14.416
Prince Xin cannot let go
of his late wife.

33:14.640 --> 33:15.960
Prince Yu has lost his beloved.

33:16.110 --> 33:18.200
- Prince Lie...
- Prince Lie wishes to marry Xihe,

33:18.200 --> 33:20.224
promising to never
take another lady in his life.

33:20.960 --> 33:21.480
That's right.

33:23.350 --> 33:25.680
Prince Lie is indeed devoted
to the Commandery Princess.

33:26.000 --> 33:27.680
But like the other princes,

33:28.310 --> 33:30.480
he is the ideal husband
for all noble ladies.

33:30.960 --> 33:31.750
When the time comes,

33:31.880 --> 33:33.640
they will all be like Gu Qingshu,

33:33.880 --> 33:35.920
using endless schemes and tricks.

33:36.016 --> 33:37.350
If Commandery Princess marries him,

33:37.590 --> 33:40.400
her future days will be filled
with unnecessary troubles, won't they?

33:44.030 --> 33:45.000
I am different.

33:46.128 --> 33:47.960
Having lived outside the palace
all these years,

33:48.030 --> 33:50.000
I have experienced the myriad changes
of the world

33:50.110 --> 33:51.790
and seen all kinds of people.

33:52.750 --> 33:54.590
No matter what kind of lady or scheme,

33:54.590 --> 33:55.744
they are useless against me.

33:56.350 --> 33:57.400
I can also be certain

33:58.200 --> 33:59.160
that in this world,

33:59.440 --> 34:01.200
no one else but the Commandery Princess

34:01.830 --> 34:02.920
can move my heart.

34:03.920 --> 34:04.750
But if you...

34:06.640 --> 34:08.920
Won't my sister end up lonely
for the rest of her life?

34:10.320 --> 34:12.030
If she marries another prince,

34:12.256 --> 34:14.400
she will never be able
to leave the imperial capital.

34:14.880 --> 34:16.230
But if I truly have a short life,

34:16.336 --> 34:18.710
she can leave the imperial capital
and return to northwest.

34:19.360 --> 34:20.920
If she meets a man she likes,

34:21.670 --> 34:22.630
she can marry again.

34:23.150 --> 34:24.000
Your family

34:24.070 --> 34:25.760
can live a peaceful and happy life.

34:30.352 --> 34:31.360
Looking at it this way,

34:31.872 --> 34:33.230
am I, your future brother-in-law,

34:33.280 --> 34:34.720
much more pleasing to the eye?

34:37.840 --> 34:39.190
I know what you say makes sense.

34:40.110 --> 34:41.630
But I have one more question.

34:42.150 --> 34:45.280
How did you know we would run into
Prince Ning and Shen Yingruo today,

34:45.280 --> 34:46.704
as well as Prince Lie and Gu Qingshu?

34:47.190 --> 34:48.320
I am no fortune-teller.

34:48.864 --> 34:50.070
I only knew that in the palace,

34:50.070 --> 34:52.080
it's rare to gather so many princes
and noble ladies

34:52.096 --> 34:53.120
all in one place.

34:53.800 --> 34:54.840
Those with ulterior motives

34:55.190 --> 34:56.710
wouldn't miss such a great opportunity.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.670
It really was just a coincidence?

35:01.030 --> 35:02.110
Or rather, good luck.

35:02.544 --> 35:03.472
Even Heaven intends

35:03.504 --> 35:06.460
to bring about this good marriage
between Commandery Princess and me.

35:08.070 --> 35:09.070
I find that

35:09.190 --> 35:10.280
I've fallen into another

35:10.280 --> 35:11.880
carefully dug trap of yours.

35:12.976 --> 35:14.416
What's more terrifying is that

35:14.840 --> 35:15.920
after falling in,

35:15.984 --> 35:18.352
I don't even feel
there's anything wrong with it.

35:25.136 --> 35:26.240
Young Master Shen,

35:26.400 --> 35:27.760
what I want to give Xihe

35:28.630 --> 35:30.230
is love and understanding.

35:31.670 --> 35:32.880
I will treat every day

35:33.320 --> 35:34.670
as if it were my last,

35:34.864 --> 35:36.360
devoting myself to her wholeheartedly.

35:37.760 --> 35:39.250
I will make every season bright for her,

35:39.960 --> 35:41.190
and be with her day and night.

35:42.070 --> 35:43.670
If you can truly keep your word,

35:43.760 --> 35:45.190
I can persuade my father.

35:46.400 --> 35:47.550
Not a single word is false.

35:50.800 --> 35:51.400
From now on,

35:51.960 --> 35:53.070
we are family.

35:59.440 --> 36:01.360
I will return to the northwest soon.

36:01.760 --> 36:02.400
My sister

36:03.030 --> 36:04.760
is entrusted to you, Your Highness.

36:05.590 --> 36:06.670
It's not an entrustment.

36:07.296 --> 36:08.210
The Commandery Princess

36:08.448 --> 36:10.630
is someone who can stand
shoulder to shoulder with men,

36:11.030 --> 36:12.230
and is even

36:12.510 --> 36:14.110
wiser and decisive than them.

36:33.952 --> 36:36.064
- Greetings, Father.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

36:36.320 --> 36:37.280
You may rise.

36:37.550 --> 36:39.030
The marriage between you two

36:39.190 --> 36:43.110
has received the approval
of Duke of Wei and Young Master Shen.

36:49.230 --> 36:49.960
Father,

36:51.008 --> 36:53.110
all these years,
while recovering from my illness,

36:53.630 --> 36:55.230
I felt my days were dark and hopeless.

36:55.550 --> 36:56.960
But Xihe didn't shy away from me.

36:56.960 --> 36:58.590
She personally attended
to my every need.

36:58.752 --> 37:00.510
Among all my talented
and handsome brothers,

37:00.760 --> 37:02.510
she favored me, a sickly man.

37:03.000 --> 37:04.590
Her affection and care

37:04.590 --> 37:05.710
are the best medicine.

37:05.904 --> 37:07.520
Having met such a wonderful lady,

37:07.670 --> 37:09.630
I will marry no one but her.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.070
Your Majesty,

37:15.760 --> 37:18.070
the Crown Prince and I
share the same interests.

37:18.070 --> 37:19.110
We are deeply in love.

37:19.630 --> 37:22.110
His appearance, intellect,
character, and demeanor,

37:22.190 --> 37:23.280
as well as his gentle nature,

37:23.630 --> 37:26.000
are truly unparalleled in this world.

37:27.030 --> 37:29.230
I will marry no one but him.

37:31.440 --> 37:32.550
I'm not that perfect.

37:33.110 --> 37:35.070
In my heart, you are the best.

37:35.800 --> 37:37.070
Of all the men in this world,

37:37.320 --> 37:38.320
only you

37:38.416 --> 37:40.704
can give me the joy
of mutual understanding and devotion.

37:41.150 --> 37:42.550
I want to walk hand in hand with you,

37:42.800 --> 37:45.280
year after year,
for the rest of our lives.

37:46.840 --> 37:47.630
Good.

37:47.880 --> 37:48.880
Excellent.

37:50.550 --> 37:52.070
Xihe, Huayong,

37:52.440 --> 37:54.590
the two of you are kindred spirits

37:54.590 --> 37:55.960
and deeply in love.

37:56.070 --> 37:57.550
It is truly rare.

37:58.150 --> 38:00.440
I grant this marriage.

38:01.150 --> 38:03.030
After the Jiuxiao Festival,

38:03.920 --> 38:05.590
I will officially decree your marriage.

38:06.688 --> 38:08.816
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Father.

38:22.150 --> 38:23.070
If she sees it,

38:23.070 --> 38:23.680
she will know

38:23.690 --> 38:25.320
that I am the one
with the Tagara incense.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.590
I am not the man she thinks I am,

38:26.590 --> 38:28.440
a Crown Prince with no backing.

38:29.056 --> 38:30.368
You are that Tagara Incense.

38:30.384 --> 38:32.280
You never believed
in my true feelings for you.

38:32.290 --> 38:33.420
What do true feelings matter?

38:33.430 --> 38:34.280
How many true feelings

38:34.320 --> 38:36.480
change in an instant
when faced with conflicts of power?

38:36.480 --> 38:38.830
I ask Your Highness to cooperate
and break off our engagement.

38:38.840 --> 38:39.840
I will never allow you

38:39.840 --> 38:40.840
to marry anyone else.

38:44.551 --> 38:47.491
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:48.111 --> 38:50.911
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:51.781 --> 38:58.751
♪So never uncover♪

38:58.941 --> 39:01.301
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

39:02.431 --> 39:05.161
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

39:06.121 --> 39:11.461
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

39:13.221 --> 39:16.041
♪Every answer I gave♪

39:16.841 --> 39:19.691
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

39:20.481 --> 39:23.851
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

39:24.111 --> 39:27.421
♪How hard it truly was?♪

39:30.391 --> 39:33.831
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

39:34.821 --> 39:37.151
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

39:38.421 --> 39:44.181
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

39:45.591 --> 39:48.721
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:49.171 --> 39:52.181
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:52.291 --> 39:58.931
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:58.931 --> 40:02.601
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

40:03.471 --> 40:06.231
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

40:06.671 --> 40:09.801
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

40:10.241 --> 40:16.191
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

40:17.591 --> 40:21.141
♪You'll never♪

40:21.421 --> 40:30.891
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

40:57.061 --> 41:00.541
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
